[CONTROLS]
LINK PU2 CLOSED IF NODE J2 ABOVE 52
LINK PU2 OPEN IF NODE J2 BELOW 36
LINK PU1 CLOSED AT CLOCKTIME 3 AM
LINK PU1 OPEN AT CLOCKTIME 5 AM

[RULES]
RULE A1
IF TANK T1 FILLTIME BELOW 2
THEN PUMP PU1 STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 3

RULE A2
IF TANK T1 DRAINTIME BELOW 3
OR LINK P1 FLOW ABOVE 20
THEN PUMP PU3 STATUS IS OPEN
ELSE PUMP PU3 STATUS IS CLOSED

RULE A3
IF NODE J4 DEMAND ABOVE 12
AND SYSTEM TIME > 8
THEN PUMP PU2 SETTING IS 0.9
PRIORITY 2

RULE A4
IF TANK T2 LEVEL ABOVE 6
THEN LINK P6 STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 2

RULE A5
IF TANK T2 LEVEL BELOW 2
THEN LINK P6 STATUS IS OPEN

